# AssemblyCalculus.jl vendor pointer

Clone the Julia reference implementation for cross-language parity:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Caerii/AssemblyCalculus.jl.git AssemblyCalculus.jl
```

Upstream: https://github.com/djpasseyjr/AssemblyCalculus.jl  
Maintainer fork: https://github.com/Caerii/AssemblyCalculus.jl

Until vendored, use the standalone reference at
`research/literature/cross_lang/julia/pnas_scaling.jl` for CI contract checks.
